text_blind:
13 years ago I was dismantling this beautiful South Jersey barn. I drove by and saw that it was going to be demolished, an older gentleman was there and he offered to sell the barn to me (not the land). I bought it on the spot and started to take it apart to save it. I called another General Contractor friend of mine to help dismantle it. He contacted Cold Spring Village and rebuilt the barn into what is today the Cold Spring Brewery!  
I love South Jersey history, this is my home and I’m ready to fight for it! 💪 
@coldspringbrew
